<title>UK: All three Brent dates kept - traders.</title>
<headline>All three Brent dates kept - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>All three Brent cargoes nominated from the paper chains on Thursday were kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>Two cargoes, loading Dec 27-29 were kept by Vitol and the third was kept by J.P. Morgan, they said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
